  "notes": "{費|つい}やす implies spending a significant or noteworthy amount.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Pattern: 〜に…を{費|つい}やす (to spend ... on ~)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {時間|じかん}を{費|つい}やす: to spend time\n- お{金|かね}を{費|つい}やす: to spend money\n- {労力|ろうりょく}を{費|つい}やす: to expend effort\n- {年月|ねんげつ}を{費|つい}やす: to spend years\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {費|つい}やす: to spend/devote (implies significance, often written style)\n- {使|つか}う: to use, to spend (general, everyday)\n- かける: to spend (time/money, neutral)",
